# The runtime dependencies of the runwhen-capability SDK (requirements-sdk.txt), for the
# rw-worktree image, which ships nothing else from PyPI. Copied from the SDK's pyproject.toml
# at the pinned tag; if that list changes, `pip check` in the image build fails until this one
# catches up. (rw-checks gets the same packages from requirements-tools.txt, artifact-tools from
# requirements-artifact-tools.txt.)
#
# requirements-sdk-deps.txt is GENERATED from this file. --exclude-newer keeps every resolved
# package at least two weeks old; move the date forward to take newer releases:
#
#   uv pip compile requirements-sdk-deps.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#       --python-version 3.12 --exclude-newer 2026-10-10 \
#       --output-file requirements-sdk-deps.txt
